    },
    {
      "id": "source-1",
      "index": 1,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 194,
      "end": 269,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第二步：选择互不相同的三角形数 T_n,T_{n+1},…,T_{2n−2}。这些下标各不相同，且 k→T_k 严格递增，因此选出的三角形数互不相同。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_1",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-2",
      "index": 2,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 270,
      "end": 358,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第三步：把第二步选出的倒数相加，裂项相消可得\n∑_{k=n}^{2n−2}1/T_k=2∑_{k=n}^{2n−2}(1/k−1/(k+1))=2(1/n−1/(2n−1))。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_2",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-3",
      "index": 3,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 359,
      "end": 424,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第四步：由于 n 为正整数，2(1/n−1/(2n−1))=1/n。故选出的有限个互异三角形数倒数之和恰好等于 1/n，题目得证。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
